{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>名模熊黛林（Lynn）日前迎來46歲生日，在社交平台曬出估計是在家中慶祝的照片。相中熊黛林捧着一大束粉紅玫瑰，對著鏡頭甜笑自拍，背景則是開揚的城市景色，顯得心情極佳。而另一張相則是與老公郭可頌的親密合照，可見這束充滿愛意的鮮花正是由郭可頌所送。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林收埋寶貝女 郭可頌貼溫馨全家福</h2>\n<p>對比起熊黛林只公開獨照和夫妻合照，郭可頌似乎更注重家庭生活。在為老婆慶祝生日後，他於昨日（11日）凌晨在IG分享全家幅。相中一對雙胞胎女兒亦有出鏡，郭可頌更以英文留言冧妻，大讚熊黛林是最閃耀、最善良、最貼心的人，並祝太太生日快樂。</p>\n<img alt=\"郭可頌百億家族背景顯赫，其已故父親郭達昌是香港知名「塑膠大王」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85b70c1150552c8237fb8ad03969e718/2026-08/4ab8a22cgy1fxmxo3xbhzj20sg0lctc8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林早前為郭可頌慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da33ef04bb04dbce2216a1b3f568359d/2026-08/lynnx1010_1786417823_3961081839645240078_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia完全唔似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30f5f9e11c5fd50a1d8e2e67b36acfd1/2026-08/lynnx1010_1786417823_3961081837707406420_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林昨日（10日）46歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/212b1900eb1fd73d0fbb752918cfb396/2026-10/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林收到鮮花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7abceb8860897a4064f3dd0d8168593/2026-10/LYNN_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a6516eeaa3a8fbcc278dc0a7c6d05f1/2026-10/LYNN_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林獲老公及一對孖女慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ca1dc7be01cd29acae39bdce6857a91/2026-10/LYNN_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林收到的蛋糕同樣是玫瑰花造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf86a3e9e44a5a398fd7801f46aae908/2026-10/LYNN_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林每年生日都會跟老公放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac3111bd9c9385814c08d6ace7d6da75/2025-10/LYNN_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林每年生日都晒全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e61b70d3e92e411cc839aaafa98b6f6/2025-10/LYNN_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後非常幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01464873ca2b70a3bb1aa01647709704/2024-10/Lynn_136_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚姻生活美滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6192e2c29d118d9593acaff0b33b8dfe/2024-10/Lynn_138_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公拍拖食早餐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8f269983cdedb6ffb69b67588f4bc2f/2025-03/LYNN_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公慶祝結婚8周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b5119f15f47cb2b6f7330838fddea0a/2024-10/Lynn_137_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林慶祝結婚9周年紀念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d51cafe350a3a6a0b64b11c72e3cb84e/2025-10/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林老公郭可頌上載合照，慶祝結婚9周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9278d69f49247c310838ea1e2643dea3/2025-10/LYNN_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林老公郭可頌表示：「照片是我一直很喜歡的。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/276b4e7c42123a08111ae6cb8492ca80/2025-10/LYNN_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2016年嫁身家豐厚的郭可頌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0caf9e34d967db86b03d4a1a6bf3d4c6/2023-10/_8300336.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2018年誕下一對異卵雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7367977cea77dcd3c4ae572a558382d7/2023-03/LYNN_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2018年誕下異卵雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2de2bbbf4e7e21793d09b694a02b3d06/2023-03/LYNN_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林為兩個寶貝女舉行百日宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c0f41ccead8b31f7ffff402d5ca9fb7/2023-03/LYNN_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2018年誕下雙胞胎女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f5b53246be7a1c4e9627cfe87fb61f2/2024-10/Lynn_139_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與郭可頌疫情後，曾三代同堂去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cddc12878f5933d3531d01dbef01c2d5/2023-06/Lynn%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾經帶兩女，陪老公及奶奶遊日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ea0a899d12dc7984aa888ecda5b83b1/2023-06/Lynn%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭媽媽站在兒子及媳婦熊黛林中間，感情很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/228e37d46ea9f8e462e9251575ad8b07/2023-06/Lynn%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公郭可頌早前帶一對囡囡遊加拿大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12b736cf0e66668e8276ccbc06b3e167/2024-07/lynn_193_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭可頌三代同堂重回昔日求學之地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d933da01197c51261309437d774475e/2024-07/lynn_194_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林老公郭可頌帶家人探望當年求學時所住的寄住家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d48f90a42311aaa535e67541b68a67f/2024-08/lynn_141.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民經常拿一對孖女作比較，指兩姊妹顏值差距大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7e9411e2cef04618b9a330457a81193/2023-03/LYNN_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民讚大女Kaylor五官精緻、雙眼皮深邃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08930b5aebfe6777ab4b09d6709863b5/2023-03/LYNN_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指細女Lyvia擁有單眼皮和圓潤嘴型，長得不太似媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0264b99f241e8d18260f7df8f7be72e/2023-03/LYNN_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林的一對女兒小時候比較似媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a23547a417e7ebfdc4c88bff5cf14ff/2023-03/LYNN_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林的一對孖女快高長大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/970bd7643cfa791eb8ed5de34e4963c3/2025-01/KWOK_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林老公分享一家四口合照，大女Kaylor（前左）的五官越來越似爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71f507553a553445937fafee387f4d2d/2025-01/KWOK_2_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>熊黛林雙胞胎女兒換牙期勁搶鏡</h2>\n<p>在這張溫馨的全家福中，熊黛林與老公郭可頌顯得越來越有夫妻相。熊黛林雖然已為人母，但樣貌身材依然保養得宜，是圈中公認的「凍齡女神」。至於一對8歲的雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia，正值換牙階段，兩個小朋友開心地擘大口，活潑地露出大牙罅，十分搶鏡。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林大女似爸爸 細女倒模媽媽</h2>\n<p>熊黛林的一對女兒因為是異卵雙胞胎，長相各具特色，經常掀起網民討論。隨着女兒長大，她們亦越長越靚，外貌更逐漸分明地偏向父母一方。網民紛紛留言指，大女Kaylor的五官極似爸爸郭可頌，而細女Lyvia的輪廓則與媽媽熊黛林如出一轍，令人不得不感慨強大基因的神奇。</p>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林已經46歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d4c408314fc3be94ca3a7f0e062002d/2023-03/LYNN_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後減少幕前演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3875335b50bd3304b98a2951890d54a7/2024-06/LYNN_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後仍繼續工作，未有做全職少奶奶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4524dea9e00505093bfc734b0e10f9c1/2025-10/LYNN_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林家庭事業兩不誤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2781f2f0511e94d99012b35cd4a2ff2/2023-08/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林獲不少廣告商垂青。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/640011fe5ac69c16e63fb21d6465b48d/2023-10/lynnx1010_1689305130_3146441948139526181_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾指內衣廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81bcab92090040ba50a42c3ec3799936/2024-05/lynn_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"駐顏有術的熊黛林身材Fit爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff9bdb109da9b6c3080d0ceed0d591fb/2023-03/LYNN_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林上圍豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ead7770aa84d4ee0a64902fa5f04281/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5k4fj011rj62002nz7uu02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林已是兩女之母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91f494a5dd6dfb178a7ee2752531e898/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5k4fhbgnvj61p329g7wh02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林擁有一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b596d002fe82193578c86031b0543d7/2023-03/LYNN_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林對胸部保養有學問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ce735475e12d6f572ba89e436bac238/2024-05/lynn_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾大談胸部下垂問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81f58e800e124d6f00d413b2f0120478/2023-03/LYNN_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後逐漸減少性感打扮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1996e9ff2b9ff7bd459f2f15e6f24600/2023-10/0909_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"模特兒出身的熊黛林身材出眾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e479e02337d472de356b69083c5435ec/2023-10/0909_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林的賀年相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36f18f9ace66e336e18448f86af4c4fa/2025-03/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾分享素顏捧花相，皮膚白滑零皺紋。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/448ef059c506769900740573b2247a21/2023-03/001sahxlgy1hb2yb6wy5dj61sc2ds4qq02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林大晒白滑長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/333c41ef9ba9279cb5e4d0f7134cbab1/2023-10/lynnx1010_1689305130_3146441947938101838_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林保養不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69d24bff6eae13da21bf159e7fc78a8c/2023-03/001sahxlgy1gz4vx8k0vwj616o1kw1kx02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林大晒曲線剪影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/925d7c4ce67fe9e359c29e93049f8623/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5fg5i8wizj62542vrhdt02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林擁有一把烏黑長髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/087d71c2efef98b730dae49e57e132a7/2023-04/LYNN%20%283%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林拍片與網民分享養生之道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb736840ac48632ffef34c9e23d11178/2023-04/LYNN%20%281%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林平日會飲紅豆湯及阿膠漿口服液。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60e19fed8b3a1e6c0e63f9bb97ab0694/2023-04/LYNN%20%285%29.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:56.045107+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":567,"images":56,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:37:52.476863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:44.032185+00:00","content_hash":"93b2a75053b80cb80704eb5d61912bf4da24c7b060f71febc7e7b8c98c7f4d98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}